          "id": "winx-description",
          "type": "text",
          "heading": "",
          "text": "Not the most complicated case (the hardest part was getting them officially verified, by the way), but definitely one of my favorites — because how often do you come to work and create memes for fairies?"
        },
        {
          "id": "winx-role",
          "type": "text",
          "heading": "",
          "text": "My role: SMM strategy, content supervision, collaboration ideas, organic promotion and paid media mechanics."
